id: F22
target: src/sello/field.nim
desc: feSqrtRatioVartime: final reject condition inverted, 'if feIsNonZero(vxx): return none[Fe]()' -> 'if not feIsNonZero(vxx): return none[Fe]()' (the second check, after the sqrt(-1) retry) -- rejects the genuinely valid sqrt-ratio cases (where the retried root now checks out) and accepts the genuinely invalid ones (no square root exists).
====OLD====
    if feIsNonZeroVartime(vxx):
      return none[Fe]()
====NEW====
    if not feIsNonZeroVartime(vxx):
      return none[Fe]()
====END====
